# Only final media is committed here (docs/media-import-1.md):
# <slug>.<f|m>.mp4, posters/<slug>.<f|m>.webp and the manifest files.
# Raw Google Flow downloads are imported with scripts/import-flow-media.mjs.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!map.json
!qc.json
!videos.js
!*.f.mp4
!*.m.mp4
!ex-*.mp4
!posters/
posters/*
!posters/*.f.webp
!posters/*.m.webp
